{"type": "say", "text": "Good morning, everyone. Thank you for joining today's curriculum review meeting. As you know, we're here to finalize the plan for replacing our seventh-grade humanities materials for the 2026-2027 school year. The draft currently proposes the Pathways Grade 6 edition, 80 printed copies, English-only materials, shared classroom-code digital access, one teacher workshop on August 12, and a student launch on August 17, 2026. I'd like to hear from each participating school function regarding your implementation requirements before we finalize the plan. Please go ahead with your reports."}
