```json
{"type": "reveal", "fact_id": "PF1", "text": "Dr. Brooks, as the Seventh-Grade Humanities Teacher, I need to report a critical implementation requirement regarding the proposed materials. During my spring pilot with the incoming cohort, I found that the Pathways Grade 6 edition repeats material these students have already mastered, while the Pathways Grade 7 edition matches the required seventh-grade sequence. I recorded these pilot results in my planning notes but have not yet sent them to the curriculum office. Based on these findings, the draft plan's proposal of the Pathways Grade 6 edition will need to be revised to the Pathways Grade 7 edition to properly serve our seventh-grade students."}
```

```json
